  "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2440 points out that cross-origin error muting is not interoperable. This is a tracking bug for writing good tests for it, adjusting the spec as appropriate, and filing implementation bugs on it.\r\n\r\nIt will probably wait until https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/958 is fixed since the infrastructure is currently pretty bonkers.",
